        "summary": "查询实时会话概览",
        "description": "查询数据库实例节点的实时会话概览信息。",
        "operationId": "ShowSessionOverview",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n用户Token。\n通过调用IAM服务[获取用户token](https://support.huaweicloud.com/intl/zh-cn/api-iam/iam_30_0001.html)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "******",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Language",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n语言。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n  - zh-cn\n  - en-us\n\n**默认取值**:\nen-us",
            "type": "string",
            "default": "en-us",
            "x-example": "en-us",
            "enum": [
              "zh-cn",
              "en-us"
            ],
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n租户在某一Region下的项目ID。\n获取方法请参见[获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-gaussdb/gaussdb_api_196.html)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n只能由英文字母、数字组成,且长度为32个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 32,
            "x-example": "43391853d5634d7e98fdcce8192e414c",
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9]{1,32}$"
          },
          {
            "name": "instance_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n实例ID,此参数是用户创建实例的唯一标识。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n只能由英文字母、数字组成,且长度为36个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 36,
            "x-example": "d414353314304bb3942517fe7f23b459in14",
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9]{1,36}$"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ShowSessionOverviewResponseBody"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "active_num": "55",
                "total_num": "100",
                "slow_sql_num": "10",
                "lock_num": "2"
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "系统内部异常。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponseBody"
            }
          }
        },
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "查询会话概览。",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET https://{endpoint}/v3/43391853d5634d7e98fdcce8192e414c/instances/66254030abf5476c95497c9fd16bcc61in14/session-overview"
